Package: bodsr2
Title: Call the Bus Open Data Service (BODS) API Through R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Nancy", "Pickering", , "dev@antonberry.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Description: An R package for accessing the Bus Open Data Service (BODS), the UK government's open data platform for bus location and timetable data in England. Provides functions to retrieve real-time vehicle locations via the SIRI-VM API and a caching layer for BODS regional GTFS timetable files, designed to feed directly into tidytransit.
